Author:&nbsp;<a href="/showmember.php?name=Bindail">Bindail</a>&nbsp;(---.abilene1.tx.home.com)<br>
Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;06-11-01 00:48<br>
<br><HTML>the alliance is for both to help each other out as if they were part of our guild. basically we are one guild but with two names. what we hope of this merger is two guilds being able to go on some, if not all, of the higher lvl raids. since we dont have enough high lvl chars in our guild and the same holds true for their guild, we were hopeing to get together and help each other out. my understanding after reading the Concillium's web page there will be a web page for both guilds to access for info about up coming events and answers to questions. itll be more or less a page for us to communicate with each other outside if the game. <br>
<br>
so the day of the alliance all are really encouraged to show up for the big day when two become one.  =) if things go well there will be some fun for all afterwards. hopefully our master brewer will have plenty of ale to pass around.<br>
<br>
so hope to see a big turn out because this WILL be a big step for our guild.<br>
<br>
